@startuml
title Scorch Action Sequence

actor User
participant CLI
participant Pyroform
participant PyroformEngine
participant PyroParser
participant SystemStateScanner
participant SystemStateComparator
participant SketchGenerator
participant PyroflowEngine

User -> CLI: scorch -i config.yaml
CLI -> Pyroform: scorch(input_path)
Pyroform -> PyroformEngine: scorch(input_path)
PyroformEngine -> PyroParser: parse(input_path)
PyroParser --> PyroformEngine: List[PyroConfig]

loop for each config
  PyroformEngine -> SystemStateScanner: scan_system_state(config)
  SystemStateScanner --> PyroformEngine: current_state
  PyroformEngine -> SystemStateComparator: compare_states(current_state, config)
  SystemStateComparator --> PyroformEngine: differences

  alt has differences
    PyroformEngine -> SketchGenerator: generate_scorch_sketch(config)
    SketchGenerator -> SketchGenerator: _generate_cleanup_commands()
    SketchGenerator --> PyroformEngine: cleanup_sketch

    alt auto_confirm or user confirms
      PyroformEngine -> PyroflowEngine: execute_sketch(cleanup_sketch)
      PyroflowEngine --> PyroformEngine: cleanup_result
    else user cancels
      PyroformEngine --> PyroformEngine: operation cancelled
    end
  else no differences
    PyroformEngine --> PyroformEngine: nothing to scorch
  end
end

PyroformEngine --> Pyroform: ScorchResult
Pyroform --> CLI: Result
CLI --> User: Success/Failure
@enduml
